WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.130
- You always have great hair.

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.440
Has it--
- Do I?

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.230
- Yes, in every character,
like in person right now,

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.720
I'm like, you can just like,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.450
it feels like you just
ran your hands through it

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.283
and then just came out here.

00:00:11.283 --> 00:00:12.116
- I did.

00:00:12.116 --> 00:00:13.560
- Looking like a stud.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:14.418
Yeah!

00:00:14.418 --> 00:00:15.251
(laughing)

00:00:15.251 --> 00:00:16.560
Is it, have you always had
great hair since you were a kid?

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.680
- No.
- No?

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.320
- I had a mother who thought it was

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.350
a really good idea for me to just sport

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:25.620
a bowl cut pretty much
through my entire adolescence

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:26.453
and into--

00:00:26.453 --> 00:00:27.286
- Oh my God!

00:00:27.286 --> 00:00:28.231
This is a picture of me too.

00:00:28.231 --> 00:00:29.250
That's what I looked like.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:30.389
- That's, we're twins.

00:00:30.389 --> 00:00:31.520
- Yeah.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.080
- That's sort of, but that was like young.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.900
You can really understand it at that age,

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:38.830
but it carried on into like middle school

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.700
and into, I mean, I feel in a way,

00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.590
Like I was kind of born
to play Spock because like

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:47.780
when I was in puberty, I had
like a full blunt bang cut.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:50.370
Like it was a, not great.

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:51.203
- Oh my God!

00:00:51.203 --> 00:00:52.810
Or it built, it was character building.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:54.290
- It was character,
literally character build--

00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:57.020
I had to arrive at a
place where I was like,

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:58.370
in the mirror, like maybe

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:00.400
the hair should be off my face, you know?

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.233
And that was a,

00:01:01.233 --> 00:01:02.530
that was a real significant moment

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:04.570
in my personal evolution I would say.

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:05.580
- It should be off your face.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:07.410
'Cause you also, this is no joke,

00:01:07.410 --> 00:01:08.700
and they didn't even know that I was going

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.394
to say this, you have my favorite
eyebrows on any man ever.

00:01:11.394 --> 00:01:12.380
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:12.380 --> 00:01:14.400
- Like you have the greatest eye--

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:16.280
You're like the Brooke Shields of men.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.280
(laughing)
Like, it's like,

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.113
you know what I'm saying?

00:01:18.113 --> 00:01:19.410
It's like, you have the greatest,

00:01:19.410 --> 00:01:21.350
I have to draw these on.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:22.742
Like these are drawn, like.

00:01:22.742 --> 00:01:24.163
- I do too.
- Shut up.

